#: contribute2.mw:1
msgid ""
"Thank you for your interest in WikiToLearn! Your knowledge is fundamental "
"for us to ensure a high standard of the content."
msgstr ""
"¡Gracies pol to interés en WikiToLearn! La to conocencia ye fundamental pa "
"nós y p'asegurar un estándar altu nel conteníu."

#: contribute2.mw:1
msgid "Step 1: Getting started"
msgstr "Pasu 1: Entamu"

#: contribute2.mw:4
msgid ""
"Search on the website if there is some material already written in your area"
" of research. Use  '''[[<ref:wikitolearn-guide-chapter-0>|this guide]]'''  "
"to learn how to review and improve the content."
msgstr ""
"Gueta nel sitiu web si hai dalgún material yá escritu nel to área"
" d'investigación. "
"Usa '''[[<ref:wikitolearn-guide-chapter-0>|esta guía]]''' pa deprender más "
"tocante a cómo revisar y ameyorar el conteníu."

#: contribute2.mw:6
msgid ""
"Otherwise, if you couldn’t find any existing material, "
"'''[[<ref:wikitolearn-guide-chapter-2>|create a new course]]''' or "
"'''[[<ref:wikitolearn-guide-chapter-3>|add new chapters]]'''."
msgstr ""
"D'otramiente, si nun pudiesti alcontrar nada, "
"'''[[<ref:wikitolearn-guide-chapter-2>|crea un cursu nuevu]]''' o "
"'''[[<ref:wikitolearn-guide-chapter-3>|amiesta capítulos nuevos]]'''."

#: contribute2.mw:8
msgid ""
"Notes, written in Word, can be simply copy pasted. For LaTeX notes you can "
"use our '''[https://texla.wikitolearn.org LaTex to Wiki Converter]'''! (read"
" more on the '''[[<ref:wikitolearn-guide-chapter-8>|LaTex guide]]''')"
msgstr ""
"Los apuntes, escritos en Word, puen copiase y apegáse fácilmente. ¡Pa los "
"apuntes en LaTeX, pues usar el nuesu '''[https://texla.wikitolearn.org"
" convertidor de LaTex a WikiToLearn]'''! "
"(llei más na '''[[<ref:wikitolearn-guide-chapter-8>|guía de LaTeX]]''')"

#: contribute2.mw:10
msgid ""
"Contact us at '''[https://chat.wikitolearn.org/channel/importing "
"#importing]''' on the WikiToLearn chat if you have any problems."
msgstr ""
"Contauta con nós en '''[https://chat.wikitolearn.org/channel/importing "
"#importing]''' na charra de WikiToLearn si tienes cualesquier problema."

#: contribute2.mw:10
msgid "Step 2: Engage your students"
msgstr "Pasu 2: Atrái a los tos estudiantes"

#: contribute2.mw:13
msgid ""
"The collaboration between you and the students on WikiToLearn will help "
"sharing knowledge worldwide. Thanks to your checking and improving we will "
"together be able to create high quality textbooks."
msgstr ""
"La collaboración ente tu y los estudiantes en WikiToLearn va ayudar a "
"compartir la conocencia col mundu. Gracies a la to revisión y ameyora, xuntos "
"vamos ser a crear llibros de testu de calidá alta."

#: contribute2.mw:15
msgid ""
"Engaging your students will help you to be aware of their understanding of "
"each lesson, providing you a valuable feedback on the effectiveness of your "
"teaching."
msgstr ""

#: contribute2.mw:15
msgid "Step 3: Spread the word"
msgstr "Pasu 3: Espardi'l mensaxe"

#: contribute2.mw:18
msgid ""
"Invite your colleagues and all the institutions you are involved in, to "
"collaborate with us and to help the project grow. A bigger network will "
"improve the quantity and quality of the resources available."
msgstr ""
"Convida a los colegues y toles instituciones nes que teas involucráu "
"pa collaborar con nós y ayudar na medra del proyeutu. Una rede más "
"grande va ameyorar la cantidá y la calidá de los recursos disponibles."

#: contribute2.mw:20
msgid ""
"Your contribution will help us creating educational material freely "
"accessible, reliable and complete."
msgstr ""
"La to collaboración va ayudanos a crear un material educativu "
"llibre, accesible, fiable y completu."


